    "Con algunos bancos el aviso de Wallet llega tarde y el atajo no alcanza a correr. Si un pago no aparece, anótalo tú." : {
      "comment" : "Setup guide, “Good to know” note.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With some banks the Wallet notification comes late and the shortcut doesn’t get to run. If a payment doesn’t show up, add it yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con el nombre que les pusiste" : {
