    },
    "No se pudo abrir una parte de tus datos para restaurarla. Tus gastos no cambiaron. Lo que no abría quedó guardado aparte en este iPhone, sin borrarse. Cierra Al día por completo, vuelve a abrirla e intenta otra vez." : {
      "comment" : "Backup error (DailyBackup.Failure), shown in alerts and said by Siri: ",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Part of your data couldn’t be opened to restore it. Your expenses didn’t change. What wouldn’t open was set aside on this iPhone, not deleted. Close Al día completely, open it again, and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No se pudo abrir «Mi dinero» para restaurarlo. Tus gastos no cambiaron. Si «Mi dinero» no abría, quedó guardado aparte en este iPhone, sin borrarse. Cierra Al día por completo, vuelve a abrirla e intenta otra vez." : {
      "comment" : "Backup error (DailyBackup.Failure), shown in alerts and said by Siri: «Mi dinero» on (hidden for launch).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“My Money” couldn’t be opened to restore it. Your expenses didn’t change. If “My Money” wouldn’t open, it was set aside on this iPhone, not deleted. Close Al día completely, open it again, and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No se pudo conservar el respaldo que tenía más, así que no se cambió nada. Abre la carpeta en Archivos, espera a que ese archivo termine de bajar de iCloud e intenta otra vez." : {
      "comment" : "Backup error (DailyBackup.Failure), shown in alerts and said by Siri: ",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The backup that had more couldn’t be kept, so nothing was changed. Open the folder in Files, wait for that file to finish downloading from iCloud, and try again."
          }
