    "Se apartan %@ de gastos fijos por venir." : {
      "comment" : "Hoy · budget ticket: VoiceOver",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ is set aside for fixed expenses still to come."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se exportan todos los meses. Importar acepta el mismo archivo y no duplica gastos: si alguno parece repetido (mismo día y monto, con otro nombre o tarjeta), pregunta antes de agregarlo. El CSV es para tu hoja de cálculo: no guarda todo (ni tus ajustes, ni tus gastos fijos), así que no sustituye al respaldo diario." : {
      "comment" : "Ajustes (SettingsView): data footer.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every month is exported. Import accepts the same file and doesn’t duplicate expenses: if one looks repeated (same day and amount, with a different name or card), it asks before adding it. The CSV is for your spreadsheet: it doesn’t keep everything (not your settings or your fixed expenses), so it doesn’t replace the daily backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se exportan todos los meses. Importar acepta el mismo archivo y no duplica gastos: si alguno parece repetido (mismo día y monto, con otro nombre o tarjeta), pregunta antes de agregarlo. El CSV es para tu hoja de cálculo: no guarda todo (ni «Mi dinero», ni tus ajustes, ni tus gastos fijos), así que no sustituye al respaldo diario." : {
      "comment" : "Ajustes (SettingsView): data footer with «Mi dinero» on (hidden for launch).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every month is exported. Import accepts the same file and doesn’t duplicate expenses: if one looks repeated (same day and amount, with a different name or card), it asks before adding it. The CSV is for your spreadsheet: it doesn’t keep everything (not “My Money”, your settings, or your fixed expenses), so it doesn’t replace the daily backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se guardaron tus gastos, pero no todos tus datos: una parte no se pudo abrir. Cierra Al día por completo, vuelve a abrirla y respalda otra vez. Si sigue igual, en ··· › Ajustes › Respaldo diario restaura el respaldo más reciente que dice «solo-gastos»: regresa tus gastos como estaban al guardarse, y lo que no abría queda guardado aparte en este iPhone, sin borrarse. Un respaldo diario anterior regresaría tus gastos al día en que se hizo." : {
      "comment" : "Backup error (DailyBackup.Failure.moneyUnreadable, «Mi dinero» hidden), shown in alerts and said by Siri: names the «solo-gastos» file to restore. «solo-gastos» is part of the file name and stays as is.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your expenses were saved, but not all of your data: part of it couldn’t be opened. Close Al día completely, open it again, and back up again. If it keeps happening, go to ··· › Settings › Daily backup and restore the newest backup with “solo-gastos” in its name: it brings your expenses back as they were when it was saved, and what wouldn’t open stays set aside on this iPhone, not deleted. An older daily backup would take your expenses back to the day it was made."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se guardaron tus gastos, pero no todos tus datos: una parte no se pudo abrir. Cierra Al día por completo, vuelve a abrirla y respalda otra vez. Si sigue igual, restaura un respaldo en ··· › Ajustes › Respaldo diario: lo que no abría queda guardado aparte en este iPhone, sin borrarse. Restaurar también regresa tus gastos al día de ese respaldo." : {
      "comment" : "Backup error (DailyBackup.Failure), shown in alerts and said by Siri: ",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your expenses were saved, but not all of your data: part of it couldn’t be opened. Close Al día completely, open it again, and back up again. If it keeps happening, restore a backup in ··· › Settings › Daily backup: what wouldn’t open stays set aside on this iPhone, not deleted. Restoring also takes your expenses back to that backup’s day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se guardaron tus gastos, pero no «Mi dinero»: no se pudo abrir. Cierra Al día por completo, vuelve a abrirla y respalda otra vez." : {
      "comment" : "Backup error (DailyBackup.Failure), shown in alerts and said by Siri: «Mi dinero» on (hidden for launch).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your expenses were saved, but not “My Money”: it couldn’t be opened. Close Al día completely, open it again, and back up again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se muestra como «%@». Si cambias el nombre, se muestra el tuyo." : {
