    "Si no aparece, abre Al día una vez y vuelve a buscar: Atajos solo conoce las apps que ya abriste." : {
      "comment" : "Setup guide, iOS 27 step-by-step: note.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If it doesn’t show up, open Al día once and search again: Shortcuts only knows the apps you’ve already opened."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si no usas Wallet, apaga el aviso y la pantalla principal deja de pedirte que lo conectes. «Dónde pagas» usa la ubicación del iPhone al anotar." : {
      "comment" : "Ajustes (SettingsView): Wallet footer.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you don’t use Wallet, turn off the alert and the main screen stops asking you to connect it. “Save where you pay” uses your iPhone’s location when an expense is added."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si no usas Wallet, apaga el aviso y la pantalla principal deja de pedirte que lo conectes. «Dónde pagas» usa la ubicación del iPhone al anotar. La ubicación está apagada para Al día en Ajustes del iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "Ajustes (SettingsView): Wallet footer, location denied.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you don’t use Wallet, turn off the alert and the main screen stops asking you to connect it. “Save where you pay” uses your iPhone’s location when an expense is added. Location is off for Al día in your iPhone’s Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si pagaste acercando el iPhone, toca para revisar el atajo. Las compras en línea no se anotan solas." : {
      "comment" : "Hoy · Wallet line under the carousel: panel detail after days without Wallet payments, iOS 26 (only tap-to-pay payments come in).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you paid by holding your iPhone near the reader, tap to check the shortcut. Online purchases aren’t added on their own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si pagaste y no llega en un par de minutos, revisa los pasos 3, 5, 6 y 7: que esté marcado «Ejecutar de inmediato», que estén elegidas tus tarjetas y que la acción tenga el importe y el comercio conectados." : {
      "comment" : "Setup guide, last step: the check that says whether payments arrive. hint while waiting (iOS 26). Step numbers of the iOS 26 guide; “Run Immediately” is the Shortcuts option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you paid and nothing showed up after a couple of minutes, check steps 3, 5, 6 and 7: that “Run Immediately” is selected, that your cards are chosen, and that the action has the amount and the merchant connected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si pagaste y no llega en un par de minutos, revisa los pasos 4, 6 y 7." : {
      "comment" : "Setup guide, last step: the check that says whether payments arrive. hint while waiting (iOS 26).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you paid and nothing showed up after a couple of minutes, check steps 4, 6 and 7."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si pierdes el iPhone, el respaldo se pierde con él. Elige una carpeta dentro de iCloud Drive." : {
